{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8e233f82-a52a-81c1-80ef-e6d9d0066ea2",
  "created_at": "2026-01-30T12:04:24-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Neusa Brito",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:00:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa Delgado. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:00:17-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. Before I begin, I would like to confirm that I have the right extension. Is this the office that takes complaints about noise?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:00:29-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "This is the City Clerk. We take a lot of general calls here, so you're in the right place to start. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:00:40-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a group of motorcycles. They gather outside in the evening and they rev the engines, every evening. It has been going on since last Thursday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:00:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since last Thursday, so that's about a week now. Okay. And where is this happening?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:01:01-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The location is 436 Ocean Avenue. [line breaks up] ...on the Ocean Drive side. They stay in the road and in front of the property next to mine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:01:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, you broke up a little. Four thirty-six Ocean Avenue, correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:01:20-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Four, three, six, Ocean Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:01:24-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And what time in the evening does it start?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:01:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Around six o'clock. It continues until approximately eight. Last night it was a little longer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:01:38-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do you know whose motorcycles they are, or is it a different group of people each night?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:01:47-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do not know the names. It appears to be the same people. Five or six motorcycles, I think. [inaudible] I cannot see all of them from my window."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:02:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll log it as a noise complaint with your address and the times."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:02:08-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I also have a question. Should I call the police non-emergency line instead of you? I want to do this correctly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:02:19-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Honestly, yes, for something that's happening right at the time, the police non-emergency line is the better route. They can send someone while the bikes are actually there. What I can do is note it here so there's a record of the pattern."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:02:39-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. So I call the police when it begins, in the evening, and you keep the record."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:02:48-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. If it's a safety issue, like dangerous driving, that's 911. But for just the revving, the non-emergency number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:02:57-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is only noise. It is not dangerous, as far as I see. Can you give me the number for the non-emergency line?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:03:08-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's listed on the city website under Police, and it's in the phone book pages too. If you hold on, I can look it up for you. [pause] Actually, I'd rather have you get it from the police page directly so you have the right one. Do you have a way to look at the website?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:03:33-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I have a computer. I will look there. Is there anything else I must do for your office?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:03:42-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, nothing else on your end. Do you want me to put a callback number on the complaint, in case someone follows up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:03:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is four zero one, five five five, zero one eight eight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:04:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-eight. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:04:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Neusa Brito. N-E-U-S-A, Brito, B-R-I-T-O."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:04:07-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Ms. Brito. I've got it down: motorcycle group, evenings, since last Thursday, 436 Ocean Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:04:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is correct. Thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:04:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:04:23-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goodbye."
    }
  ],
